id: R06
target: src/sello/ristretto.nim
desc: ristrettoEncode: sqrt(-1) rotation trigger inverted, 'let rotate = feIsNegative(tZinv)' -> 'let rotate = not feIsNegative(tZinv)' -- rotates x/y/den_inv exactly when RFC 9496 §4.3.2 says not to, and leaves them unrotated exactly when the rotation is required. RFC-004 slice 8b's "encode's rotation ... condition flip" target.
====OLD====
  let rotate = feIsNegative(tZinv)    # rotate = IS_NEGATIVE(t0 * z_inv)
====NEW====
  let rotate = not feIsNegative(tZinv)    # rotate = IS_NEGATIVE(t0 * z_inv)
====END====
